{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "弄清截距：从起点找到 y 轴截距",
    "goals": [
      "区分一次函数中的斜率与截距，建立截距是坐标轴交点数值的直觉",
      "掌握求 y 轴截距的方法：代入 x=0 验证交点坐标 (0, b)"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "认可学生的勇敢尝试，肯定抓出数字的敏锐度，同时用短跑起点的比喻厘清 2 与 5 的不同角色",
        "使用一次函数图像直观对比常数项变动对交点位置的影响"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 5,
        "min": -5,
        "max": 10,
        "label": "截距 b",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.075
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-task-01",
        "prompt": "拖动滑块，把截距调整为 3，观察直线与 y 轴相交的位置。",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "关注常数项数值",
          "当 b 为 3 时，交点在 (0, 3)"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "太棒了！交点正好移到了 (0, 3)，截距就是 3！",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 3.025,
          "tolerance": 0.0375
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "as": "section-02-task-01",
        "prompt": "把截距 b 调整到 0，观察直线经过原点时的样子：",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "将截距滑块拖动到 0。",
          "此时函数变成 y = 2x，起点正好在坐标原点 (0, 0)。"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "太棒了！当 b=0 时，直线恰好穿过原点，此时 y 轴截距就是 0！",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 0.025,
          "tolerance": 0.0375
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "reflections": [
      {
        "as": "section-02-reflection-02",
        "prompt": "对于函数 y = 2x + 6，它的 y 轴截距和 x 轴截距分别对应哪个点的数值？",
        "answer": "y 轴截距令 x = 0 得 y = 6；x 轴截距令 y = 0 得 2x + 6 = 0，解得 x = -3。",
        "anchor": "section-02-moment-01-item-02",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "纠正对 y=2x+5 截距的误判，建立截距即 y 轴起点的直觉",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "敢直接算出来就很棒！你敏锐抓出了式子里的关键数，只卡在了一个分工上：2 不是截距，2 是斜率，截距其实是 5！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "opening-title",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "弄清截距：从起点找到 y 轴截距",
                "items": [
                  "本课导入"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "y = 2x + 5"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "我们把这条直线想象成跑步路线：x 是你跑出去的步数，y 是高度。式子里的 5，就是你还没出发、也就是 x 等于 0 时的起始高度！",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "函数图像",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -5,
                    "max": 15,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((2)*(x))+(number_01)",
                    "label": "y = 2x + b"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "reference-a",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 5,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "reference-b",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 7,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "reference-a.y",
                    "expression": "((2)*(0))+(number_01)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "reference-b.y",
                    "expression": "((2)*(1))+(number_01)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant",
                "sample_input": "fixed_x"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "观察直线穿过 y 轴的交点位置",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "所谓 y 轴截距，就是直线切在 y 轴上的位置数值。当 x 为 0 时，y 等于 2 乘 0 加 5，正好是 5！而 2 代表每走一步上升 2 格，那是斜率。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 5,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "brief",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "你看，交点稳稳落在 (0, 5)。截距是位置，斜率是坡度，分工清清楚楚。稍后你也可以试着滑动参数，看看起点怎么跟着变！",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-04-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "一次函数 y = kx + b 的分工",
                "items": [
                  "k (系数 2)：斜率，表示倾斜程度",
                  "b (常数 5)：y 轴截距，表示与 y 轴交点 (0, b)"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "section-02",
      "purpose": "通过令 x=0 计算并验证任意一次函数的 y 轴截距与 x 轴截距",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "你敢直接给出答案算截距，这种主动尝试特别棒！不过 2 是斜率而不是截距。求 y 轴截距有一个万能钥匙：只要令 x 等于 0。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "x = 0 \\implies y = 2(0) + b = b"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-02-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "求两轴截距的方法",
                "items": [
                  "y 轴截距：令 x = 0，解出 y（即起点高度）",
                  "x 轴截距：令 y = 0，解出 x（地面交点）"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-02-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
                "section-02-moment-01-item-01",
                "section-02-moment-01-item-02"
              ],
              "intent": "聚焦在代入 x 等于 0 求解截距的公式上",
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "point",
              "target": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "看，当滑块在 5 的时候，直线刚好从 y 轴的 5 这个高度出发。如果把截距滑到负 2，整条登山道整体下移，起点变成了负 2。",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": -2,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "现在反过来想：那这条线什么时候踩到地面，也就是 x 轴截距又该怎么算呢？课后试试看把截距调到 0 观察一下。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-02-moment-01-item-02"
              ],
              "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "通常说的截距是 y 轴截距，对应直线穿过 y 轴的位置。令 x=0 就能轻松求出，在 y=2x+5 中截距是 5 而不是 2。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
